<mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#8A5A00&quot;&gt;This proof of concept used public endpoints on the vaults and storage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The lab policy sets public network access to Disabled, so four narrow, time-boxed policy exemptions allowed the test. &lt;b&gt;The production variant (terraform/production) uses private endpoints and VNet-integrated apps and needs no exemptions. It was planned (60 resources) and never applied.&lt;/b&gt; Telemetry endpoints stay public with Entra-only sign-in in both variants." style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=60;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=10;fontSize=11;fontColor=#323130;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#B58105;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="352" y="565" width="845" height="115" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
