<mxCell id="plan" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;What the plan creates (60 resources)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;2 function apps (AzAPI), 2 plans, 2 storage accounts with containers, queues and a table, 1 factory vault, 1 Event Grid topic with 2 subscriptions, 2 managed identities, 15 role assignments, 2 custom roles, 8 private endpoints, 3 diagnostic settings, 4 alert rules, 1 action group, 1 workspace and Application Insights, 2 zip-deployment steps and 2 waits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Not created:&lt;/b&gt; a VNet, subnets, DNS zones, the resource group, and any private endpoint for a destination vault." style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=10;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#323130;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0078D4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="455" width="755" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="d1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Destination vault (RBAC)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;with a private endpoint in the spoke VNet that you build. The sync identity gets read + import (a custom role, or Certificates Officer) on this vault only" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=58;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#323130;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#107C10;strokeWidth=1.75;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1355" y="175" width="490" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
