<mxCell id="d3" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Consumers (App Gateway, App Service, AKS, ...)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;read the copy in their own vault by the versionless secret id, so a rotation changes nothing in their configuration. The pickup time is the consumer: a gateway about 4 h (a forced refresh about 1 min), App Service within 24 h. Front Door supports only a vault in its own subscription." style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#323130;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#605E5C;strokeWidth=1.75;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1355" y="455" width="490" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
